        "wf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "value": "Underneath: white to cream angular pores running down a short pale stem.",
      "sources": [
        "fn",
        "wf"
      ]
    },
    {
      "value": "On buried and fallen dead wood of broadleaved trees, especially beech.",
